BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:DinoLab: Dig\, Build\, Learn
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260905T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260905T160000
UID:260903h-6VtLqzs0CeEjvkP5HdcQ
DESCRIPTION:Special ticketed event - space is limited! Travel back to the 
 age of dinosaurs at DinoLab! Enjoy hands-on activities\, science explorati
 on\, and creative workshops designed for dino enthusiasts of all ages. Cho
 ose a morning or afternoon session and dive into discovery. Dates: Saturda
 y Sept. 5 Monday\, Sept 7 Times: Session 1: 10am - 12:30pm Session 2: 1:30
 pm - 4:00pm Hands-on Activities \\(Each Session\\): Dino Dioramas \\(Best 
 for ages 3-6\\) Build a take-home prehistoric scene using miniature dinosa
 urs\, natural materials\, and sensory-friendly elements-perfect for imagin
 ative play and early science exploration. Micro Dino Dig \\(Best for ages 
 6 and up\\) Excavate mini dinosaur skeletons from the Cretaceous Period wh
 ile learning real fossil recovery techniques and how scientists study anci
 ent life. Plus: DinoPrints Play Dough Dino Eggs Dinosaur Puzzles Tree of L
 ife Puzzles Fossil Rubbings  Prices Per Session - Tickets and Advance Regi
 stration Required Member: $8 \\+ Free Member Admission Non-member: $8 \\+ 
 price of admission Access pass: $4 \\+ price of admission Reserve your tic
 keted session early-spots will go fast! Museum admission is required for f
 ree activities. WonderLab members receive discounted ticketed event pricin
 g. Full schedule and tickets available at wonderlab.org Purchase Admission
 : Online -  Purchase DinoLab Tickets At the WonderLab front desk Note: Din
 o-Lab is a ticketed add-on program\, and the Dino-Lab ticket price include
 s museum admission for the participant. Only those participating in the sp
 ecial activities need a Dino-Lab ticket. Adult / Guardians etc. who are no
 t participating do not need a Dino-Lab ticket\, but do need regular museum
  admission. Children: Need a Dino-Lab ticket \\(includes museum admission\
 \). Adults / Guardians: Do not need a Dino-Lab ticket unless they want to 
 make their own diorama or have their own dig. Adults / Guardians: Must pur
 chase regular museum admission.
LOCATION:Wonderlab
URL:https://wonderlab.org/event/dinolab/2026-09-05/
X-SOURCE:Limestone Post
END:VEVENT
