BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Toddler Sports Classes
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260905T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260905T120000
UID:260324s51tnVmiU0iiH-H-ocZPAA
DESCRIPTION:Playpen Sports Academy is a wonderful way to introduce your ch
 ild to the world of sport and physical activity in a non-intimidating envi
 ronment with a small group of other toddlers and parents. The Playpen Spor
 ts Academy Curriculum is focused on a number of different goals including 
 teaching children how to move and use their bodies\, sharing with other ch
 ildren\, interact in social settings\, follow directions\, and most import
 antly how to have fun in a physically active environment. At Playpen Sport
 s Academy\, we are focused as much on the individual development of your c
 hild as we are on sport specific skills that we teach. Because while we ex
 pect some of your children to go on to be great athletes\, we expect all o
 f your children to go on to be great people!
URL:https://www.playpensports.com/
X-SOURCE:Limestone Post
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:"Skills for Disagreeing Better" Braver Angels Workshop
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260905T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260905T110000
UID:260904M8LhP77PX0aUG4zc1zmm4A
DESCRIPTION:This two-hour in-person workshop teaches better skills for sha
 ring viewpoints in a way the other person might hear - even if they disagr
 ee - and to better understand the values and concerns of people who differ
  from you politically. Launched in 2016\, Braver Angels is a non-profit bi
 partisan citizen's movement to unify America. By bringing Americans togeth
 er into a working alliance\, Braver Angels is building new ways to talk to
  one another\, participate together in public life\, and influence the dir
 ection of the nation. Indiana Braver Angels began in 2018 with the Red/Blu
 e workshop in Bloomington. A local alliance started soon thereafter and is
  now leading weekly conversations. In this polarized time\, we lack basic 
 understanding of why people on the other political side hold their beliefs
 . We don't see them as they see themselves - their core values and central
  concerns - but instead as we choose to see them. We are tempted to regard
  our own side as principled and the other side as self-interested. When we
  try to communicate across this gap\, we often lack the skills for listeni
 ng carefully\, looking for common ground\, and sharing our perspectives in
  ways that connect rather than create more misunderstanding. By creating o
 pportunities for meaningful discussions\, Braver Angels works to dial down
  the heated rhetoric that gets in the way of real conversations and accura
 te understanding of our differences. The objective is not to push an agend
 a or change participant's minds\, but rather to provide a safe place for d
 eeper understanding. RSVP is requested at www.BraverAngels.org/indiana \\(
 Promo Code "BRAVER" for free registration\\) as seating is limited. \\*\\*
  This event is open to the media upon approval. Send requests to press@bra
 verangels.org
LOCATION:ids@iu.edu
URL:https://guides.idsnews.com/happenings/event/skills-for-disagreeing-bet
 ter-braver-angels-workshop
X-SOURCE:Limestone Post
END:VEVENT
