BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Sprouts Farmers Market Broadway Block Party
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260906T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260906T110000
UID:260905ToF6pICmd0iBWI5Zk5qnww
DESCRIPTION:Traveling for Labor Day weekend? Get ready for an action-packe
 d weekend of Hoosier volleyball in the heart of Nashville at the Sprouts F
 armers Market Broadway Block Party on Sunday\, Sept. 6\, 2026\, at Bridges
 tone Arena. This double-header collegiate volleyball showdown features top
  teams from the Big Ten\, SEC and ACC\, including your Indiana Hoosiers\, 
 battling it out in a high-energy\, fast-paced competition. With elite tale
 nt\, intense rivalries and the electric atmosphere of Music City\, this is
  an event you won't want to miss. Come for the matchups\, stay for the exc
 itement and experience volleyball at its best. Match 1: Louisville Cardina
 ls vs. Texas Longhorns @ 11 a.m. CT on ABCMatch 2: Tennessee Lady Vols vs.
  Indiana Hoosiers @ 2:00 p.m. CT on ESPN2 Tickets are on sale now through 
 Ticketmaster. One ticket provides access to both matches for a one-time en
 trance. Exit and reentry are not allowed.
URL:https://guides.idsnews.com/happenings/event/the-sprouts-farmers-market
 -broadway-block-party
X-SOURCE:Limestone Post
END:VEVENT
