UID:2609035xGkeFcVw0SbW3qioc5I0Q
DESCRIPTION:September Theme: Entomology Day: Thursday Time: 4 - 5:45pm Rec
 ommended Ages: Designed for children ages 6 - 10\, but siblings are welcom
 e. Location: WonderLab Cost: Free for Members / Free with Museum Admission
  Curiosity Lab is an after-school\, free play program for kids ages 6-10 y
 ears. Children are invited to explore\, experiment\, and engage in hands-o
 n sensory activities at their own pace. No instructions\, no pressure-just
  curiosity-driven play. Held in WonderLab \\(or sometimes outdoors weather
  permitting\\)\, the space is set up for exploration with a variety of rot
 ating materials and stations. There will be one main activity/installment/
 manipulative for the month that will be brought out every Thursday. This w
 ill rotate with the month and the month's theme.
LOCATION:Wonderlab
URL:https://wonderlab.org/event/curiosity-lab-10/2026-09-10/
X-SOURCE:Limestone Post
END:VEVENT
