DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260911T230000
UID:260904zXtwYYn47kmCS9jRto1Bvw
DESCRIPTION:Join us and your local wordsmiths for a night of poetry\, liba
 tions\, and passion! The night begins with an open mic featuring local art
 ists\, singers\, musicians\, and writers then ends with a poetry slam. Fea
 tured Poet\, Wesley Frazier-Keys\, will have a set in-between the two roun
 ds of the poetry slam.\n\nFeatured Poet for September is Wesley Frazier-Ke
 ys!\n\nWesley Frazier-Keys is an award-winning poet\, spoken word artist\,
  educator\, and teaching artist from Chicago’s South Side. A two-time Ch
 icago Grand Slam Champion\, Wesley has competed nationally and internation
 ally\, including finalist appearances at the Southern Fried Poetry Festiva
 l. He is the 2022 NFSPS BlackBerryPeach Spoken Word National Champion and 
 the 2025 Gwendolyn Brooks Open Mic Award Champion. His viral spoken-word v
 ideo has garnered more than 2.4 million views\, amplifying his powerful wo
 rk to audiences worldwide. His poetry blends personal experience\, cultura
 l heritage\, education\, and community\, using language to inspire\, chall
 enge\, and connect.
LOCATION:The Bishop Bar
URL:https://www.facebook.com/share/19QvMv5fed/
X-SOURCE:Limestone Post
END:VEVENT
