DESCRIPTION:September Theme: Environmental Science Day: Friday Times 3 - 4
 pm Recommended for: All ages Event Price Free for Members / Free with Muse
 um Admission Get closer to the wild side with Animal Hour and Dive Deeper!
  These weekly programs let you chat with WonderLab's animal experts\, disc
 over what it takes to care for creatures from around the globe\, and meet 
 snakes\, lizards\, insects\, arachnids\, and more-up close and out of thei
 r habitats. Animal Hour takes place on most Fridays\, while Dive Deeper ha
 ppens on the last Friday of each month at WonderLab's stunning coral reef 
 aquarium. Type of Activities Animal Hour: Meet our animal ambassadors. Exp
 lore different environments. Dive into ecology and evolution. Type of Acti
 vities Dive Deeper: Interactive demonstrations.
