BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Founders Exhibition - Frederick W. Rigley
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260911T000000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260911T000000
UID:260824q8S7YaoYtkuyErA9QHj4AQ
DESCRIPTION:September 11 – November 1\, 2026   \n\nThe Brown County Ar
 t Guild proudly presents the Founders Exhibition: Frederick W. Rigley\, ho
 noring one of the Guild’s founding artists and an important figure in th
 e development of Brown County’s artistic legacy. Drawn from private coll
 ections\, this exhibition brings together a rare selection of paintings th
 at reflect Rigley’s deep appreciation for the landscapes\, light\, and c
 haracter of southern Indiana. \n\nAs a founding member of the Brown County
  Art Guild\, Rigley helped establish an institution dedicated to preservin
 g and promoting the artistic traditions of the region. His work captures t
 he enduring beauty of Brown County while reflecting the values that shaped
  the early Guild—craftsmanship\, observation\, and a profound connection
  to place. \n\nBy gathering these seldom-seen works\, the exhibition offer
 s visitors a unique opportunity to explore Rigley’s artistic contributio
 ns and gain a deeper understanding of the artists whose vision helped buil
 d one of Indiana’s most respected cultural organizations.
LOCATION:Brown County Art Guild
URL:https://browncountyartguild.org/event/founders-exhibition-frederick-w-
 rigley/
X-SOURCE:Limestone Post
END:VEVENT
