 nday\, September 13\, 2026 \n\nBrown County Inn \n\nLooking for that speci
 al piece to finish an arrangement or round out your collection? Art auctio
 ns remind us that the value of art is not just in its price\, but in the s
 tories\, history\, and emotions it embodies. Join us for a dynamic afterno
