SUMMARY:Friends of the Library Big Fall Book Sale September 17-21
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260921T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260921T140000
UID:260820LLwGac_BvkWN1qGA_qFNsQ
DESCRIPTION:The Friends of Monroe County Public Library present the Big Fa
 ll Book Sale. All books are just 50¢ to $2.00. The sale reflects the brea
 dth of our community’s interests – add to your choices for cooking\, d
 elve into a new area in history\, or find good books for \\(grand\\)childr
 en. Fiction\, biography\, politics\, DVDs\, music\, and much more are in g
 ood supply\, with new material added every day.\n\nThursday\, September 17
 : 4:00–7:00 PM \\(Early bird sale for Friends members only: you can join
  at the door or online at mcpl.info.friends\\).\n\nOpen to the public:\n\n
 Friday\, September 18: 10 AM–6 PM \\(all books 50¢ to $2.00\\)\n\nSatur
 day\, September 19: 10 AM–6 PM \\(all books 50¢ to $2.00\\)\n\nSunday\,
  September 20: Noon–6 PM \\(fill a Friends tote bag for $12\; fill a box
  for $18\\)\n\nMonday\, September 21: 9 AM–2 PM \\(all remaining items a
 re free\\)\n\nThe sale is in Meeting Rooms 1B/1C on the ground floor of th
 e Monroe County Public Library at 303 E. Kirkwood Avenue\, Bloomington IN 
 47408. All proceeds support the programs and services of the Library.
LOCATION:Monroe County Public Library- Downtown Branch
URL:http://mcpl.info/bigsale
X-SOURCE:Limestone Post
END:VEVENT
