UID:260824ak1BZUVqgE-VLJstgGIdVQ
DESCRIPTION:Every Thursday starting 07/02 and ending 09/24\, 4-5:45pm Curi
 osity Lab is an after-school\, free play program for kids ages 6-10 years.
  Children are invited to explore\, experiment\, and engage in hands-on sen
 sory activities at their own pace. No instructions\, no pressure-just curi
 osity-driven play. Held in WonderLab \\(or sometimes outdoors weather perm
 itting\\)\, the space is set up for exploration with a variety of rotating
  materials and stations. There will be one main activity/installment/manip
 ulative for the month that will be brought out every Thursday. This will r
 otate with the month and the month's theme. Recommended Ages: Designed for
  children ages 6 - 10\, but siblings are welcome.
LOCATION:Wonderlab
URL:https://guides.idsnews.com/happenings/event/curiosity-lab-at-wonderlab
X-SOURCE:Limestone Post
END:VEVENT
