BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Creative Writing for all genders
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261001T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261001T203000
UID:260811giUVXEHzkkat2OWRZzx8Yg
DESCRIPTION:This class welcomes participants into a creative and supportiv
 e space for writing and exploration. Together\, we’ll draw inspiration f
 rom poetry\, stories\, memoir\, and our own imaginations. Whether you want
  to share personal experiences\, create fictional worlds\, or discover dee
 per truths through writing\, you’ll find an encouraging community where 
 your voice can grow and thrive.\n\nAdults (18+) of all genders are welcome
 .\n\nFacilitated by Amy Cornell and Mary Beth O'Brien
LOCATION:Women Writing for (a) Change Bloomington
URL:https://www.womenwritingbloomington.org/product/creative-writing-for-a
 ll-genders-fall-2026/
X-SOURCE:Limestone Post
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Lotus Festival: All Inclusive Four-Day Pass
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261001T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261001T213000
UID:260719sh4pO089QUq7UUZakSW6pQ
DESCRIPTION:**Lotus World Music & Arts Festival** showcases the exceptiona
 l talent of performing artists and musicians from around the globe. With a
  sense of discovery\, exploration\, and celebration\, people of all ages\,
  ethnicities\, abilities\, and backgrounds come to Bloomington\, IN to exp
 erience Lotus over multiple days and venues. For over 30 years\, this fest
 ival has been supported by countless community partners\, sponsors\, and v
 olunteers.\n\n20 Artists\, 40 performances\, over 4 days – Discover the 
 music. Explore the arts. Celebrate world cultures. Experience Lotus – In
 diana’s premiere music festival and annual celebration of music\, arts\,
  and culture.\n\nArtist Line Up Coming Soon – Check back later!\n\nThe *
 *All Inclusive Pass** will get you access to the Thursday night Opening Co
 ncert at the Buskirk-Chumley Theater\, all concerts at all venues on Frida
 y and Saturday\, and the Sunday Closing Concert at the Buskirk-Chumley The
 ater. **September 30th is the last day to Purchase an All Inclusive Pass.
 **\n\n**Wristbands:**\n\nAll Inclusive Wristbands will be available to pic
 k up in the lobby of the Buskirk-Chumley theater starting Thursday the 1st
  at 5:30pm. Wristbands are not replaceable and must be worn all weekend to
  enjoy the festival. Wristbands not picked up on Thursday will be availabl
 e at the Wristband Tents on the Friday and Saturday of the festival\, when
  they open at 5:30pm. Please have your ID and ticket available at the time
  of pick up.\n\n**Lotus Pins:**\n\nThe 2026 commemorative Lotus Pin will b
 e available for pick up at a table in the lobby of the Buskirk-Chumley The
 ater on Sunday\, October 4th when doors open for the Closing Concert. Plea
 se have your wristband and ID available at the time of pickup.\n\n**Dates 
 & Schedule**: The complete schedule will be available on the Lotus Fest 
 website. A printed pamphlet will be available at arrival.\n\n**10/1\, 7pm 
 – 9:30pm** Festival Opening Concert at Buskirk-Chumley Theater\n\n**10/2
 \, 6pm – 12am** Friday Showcase at Multiple Venues\n\n**10/3\, 12pm – 
 12am** Saturday Showcase at Multiple Venues\n\n**10/4\, 3pm – 5pm** Clos
 ing Concert at Buskirk-Chumley Theater\n\n**Maps & Venues**: Maps of the f
 estival will be available on the Lotus Fest website. A printed pamphlet w
 ill be available at arrival.\n\n**Buskirk-Chumley Theater** – 114 E Kir
 kwood Ave.\n\n**First Christian Church** – 205 E Kirkwood Ave.\n\n**6th
  Street Stage** – 6th St between College Ave. and Walnut St.\n\n**Arts V
 illage Stage** – Kirkwood between College Ave. & Walnut St.\n\n**The Bi
 shop Bar** **(18+)** – 123 S. Walnut St.\n\n**The BlockHouse Bar (21+)
 ** – 205 S. College Ave.\n\nOur family friendly venues include the Busk
 irk-Chumley Theater\, Arts Village Stage\, and Church venues. The outdoor 
 tent can be louder and more boisterous\, and occasionally\, political stat
 ements are made. Parents should make their own decisions about which venue
 s they choose to attend.
LOCATION:Buskirk Chumley Theater
URL:https://buskirkchumley.org/events/lotus-festival-all-inclusive-four-da
 y-pass-october-1-2026/#buy
X-SOURCE:Limestone Post
END:VEVENT
