SUMMARY:Rocky Horror Picture Show 2026
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261024T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261024T204500
UID:260905LmKmtOkh_kiWTcJ6XL238w
DESCRIPTION:Let’s do the Time Warp again! Constellation Stage & Screen c
 ontinues The Rocky Horror Picture Show tradition this October with an inte
 ractive screening at the Buskirk-Chumley Theater. Grab your props\, shout 
 your favorite callbacks\, and dance in the aisles to celebrate this cult c
 lassic in all its outrageous glory. Whether you’re a seasoned fan or a R
 ocky Horror newbie\, this is your chance to throw toast\, toss toilet pape
 r\, and fully immerse yourself in the madness. Don’t dream it\, be there
 !\n\n*Please note: The 7pm screening will include subtitles.*\n\n***Pre-Sh
 ow Costume Contest & Devirginization:***\n\nJoin us 30 minutes prior to th
 e screening\, at 6:30pm\, for our highly anticipated pre-show event\, feat
 uring a costume contest\, fabulous prizes\, devirginization ceremony\, and
  more!\n\n**Prop bags are available as a $5 add-on purchase in advance or 
 in the lobby before the show (while supplies last)!** Prop bags contain o
 ne everything you need for the ultimate Rocky Horror experience\, includin
 g: Newspaper\, Party Hat\, Playing Card\, Toilet Paper\, Rice\, Squirt Gun
 \, Noise Maker\, Rubber Glove\, Bells\, Toast\, and a handy Audience Parti
 cipation Guide.\n\nThe Rocky Horror Picture Show is Rated R\, recommended 
 for mature audiences.
LOCATION:Buskirk Chumley Theater
URL:https://buskirkchumley.org/events/rocky-horror-picture-show-2026-octob
 er-24-2026/
X-SOURCE:Limestone Post
END:VEVENT
